      "identityEvidence": "R21/RE260: 28 g, Ø24×27 mm, 2 mm shaft, 6200 rpm/170 mA at 1.5 V and 12700 rpm/240 mA at 3 V. R23/RE280 R: 42 g, Ø24×30 mm, 2 mm shaft, 1.5–4.5 V, with original no-load/loaded speed pairs 2300/1700,5200/4220,7800/6510 rpm. These values independently match the historical OPITEC 224035/224057 descriptions. Bare motors of different winding, end cap or shaft are not substitutes.",
